        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion U5,  EL Tovar Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe EL Tovar Handleset is a beautiful merger of rustic beauty and contemporary design. As part of Fusion's American Relic Collection, this entrance set pulls from historic designs but in a way that is in line with the most popular design aesthetics of the top home decorators. Choose from antique pewter, medium bronze, or dark bronze finishes. The  EL Tovar Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is available in dummy or single cylinder functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion U5 American Relic Collection EL Tovar Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion EL Tovar Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>One Year Finish Warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "EL Tovar Handleset, Fusion U5",
                "description": "Fusion U5, EL Tovar Handleset - The EL Tovar Handleset is a beautiful merger of rustic beauty and contemporary design. As part of Fusion's American Relic Collection, this entrance set pulls from historic designs but in a way that is in line with the most popular design aesthetics of the top home decorators. Choose from antique pewter, medium bronze, or dark bronze finishes. The  EL Tovar Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is available in dummy or single cylinder functions.",
